; p22 - Is `Storage : <UDF>` how a Field reads a user defined field?
; Used for all 84 former `Field-Id:` occurrences.
[Report: ZzP22Report]
    Form: ZzP22Form

[Form: ZzP22Form]
    Parts: ZzP22Part

[Part: ZzP22Part]
    Lines: ZzP22Line

[Line: ZzP22Line]
    Field: ZzP22Field

[Field: ZzP22Field]
    Storage : JwlShopName
    Set As : $JwlShopName
    Width : 40
